  "what": "problem PD-1@v1 drafted",
  "phase": "DISCOVER",
  "minute": 55.0,
  "event_seq": 104,
  "root_problem": "Since August 2026, field manual-read route completion for the contracted field service (ORG-FIELD) fell to 0.88 against a 0.95 target across 9200 accounts (E-02); the resulting incomplete/late reads trigger estimate substitution at billing import, producing ESTIMATED-read bills that account for part of the Aug-Sep dispute surge (E-01, E-07). Dispute response handling remains within SLA (E-03), so this field-read-coverage degradation — not slow ticket handling — is the best-supported mechanism, though it explains only the ESTIMATED-read minority (1240/3025) of disputed bills, leaving the ACTUAL-read majority (1785/3025) unexplained by current evidence."
 },
