  "phase": "DEFINE",
  "minute": 119.0,
  "event_seq": 282,
  "root_problem": "Since 2026-08-01, billing import validation rule BV-17 compares raw AMI register values against a 12-month m3 consumption history with no unit scaling (E-13); because v4.2-firmware AMI meters (rollout 2026-06) report registers in '0.1 m3' units versus the 'm3' units of older firmware (E-14), this mismatch causes otherwise-normal reads to be flagged high-consumption and rejected at import, driving 1184 of the 1240 ESTIMATED-read disputed bills via estimate substitution (E-12). This explains part of the Aug-Sep dispute surge (E-07) but not the larger ACTUAL-read segment (1785/3025, E-01), whose cause is still unestablished."
 },
